# novac/divergences.allow — conscious behaviour divergences from the oracle.
#
# CONTRACT (plan 274 §10.3a; enforced by check-novac-differential.sh): one
# line = one fixture path from the repo root, forward slashes, exact match.
# A line here says "novac and the oracle disagree on this fixture ON
# PURPOSE" — and every line MUST have its story in
# docs/dev/novac-divergences.md (what differs, why ours is right, which
# D-block if the divergence is visible language behaviour). A line without a
# story is a silent language change — the exact thing the ledger exists to
# forbid.
#
# Empty is the healthy state.
